mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.6em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>16</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>So, the formula for the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"7\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>th term is:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"8\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 9.749em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0.139em; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"